The question/conjecture as formulated in <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/Artin-power-series">Artin-power-series</a>]</span>, <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/Artin-Denef">Artin-Denef</a>]</span>, and <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/popescu-global">popescu-global</a>]</span> is stronger and was shown to be equivalent to the original version in <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/Cipu">Cipu</a>]</span>.